{"channelId":"UCsWcid8jnURlKAzoK3YB3jQ","row":["Animal Education with Cole Shirk",2360,"I have created this channel to educate the public about animals. If it slithers, crawls, walks, runs or flies, has feathers, scales, fur or hide, I want to learn about it and you will find it here.  I'm thankful for all the people at the zoos, rescues, aquariums, colleges, state parks, animal parks and education centers that work with me and their support.  I've had the great opportunity to work with everything from green tree frogs to the largest elephant, venomous and non-venomous animals and got to meet some great people as well.  So if you love reptiles, amphibians, birds, mammals and fish, just keep watching!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsWcid8jnURlKAzoK3YB3jQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsWcid8jnURlKAzoK3YB3jQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:02.259Z","channelId":"UCsWcid8jnURlKAzoK3YB3jQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"619335f6705dd4e23217b63dc3bf4a6533af007f515127f2f69a9bf44eff897f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"238069da14ce50f82fd7da7d9f0fe72d0ade07fe6295bffa8e46801b35c7af5b"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsWcid8jnURlKAzoK3YB3jQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2360,"raw":"2.36K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsWcid8jnURlKAzoK3YB3jQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:02.259Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rS4y_T7H5EE"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"I have created this channel to educate the public 